https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2412\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2412-TW</a>)</p></section><section><p>4. 外資累計買超 2 日的股票<br/>臺企銀 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2834:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2834\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2834-TW</a>)、台中銀 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2812:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2812\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2812-TW</a>)、中華電 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2412:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2412\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2412-TW</a>)、合庫金 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:5880:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/5880\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">5880-TW</a>)、第一金 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2892:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2892\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2892-TW</a>)</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>5. 外資當日 (14) 買超的股票<br/>臺企銀 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2834:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2834\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2834-TW</a>)、強茂 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2481:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2481\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2481-TW</a>)、聯電 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2303:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2303\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2303-TW</a>)、中華電 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2412:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2412\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2412-TW</a>)、第一金 (<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2892:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2892\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2892-TW</a>)<br/> </p></section></main>",
